{"ref":"BDB, נֶ֫גֶב","hw":"נֶ֫גֶב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נֶ֫גֶב</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] south-country, Negeb, south <strong>(</strong>cf. Lag<sup>BN 78</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 20:1\" href=\"/Genesis.20.1\">Gn 20:1</a> +; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:2\" href=\"/Joshua.11.2\">Jos 11:2</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶ֫גְבָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:14\" href=\"/Genesis.13.14\">Gn 13:14</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>south-country</em>, i.e. <strong>a.</strong>  specif. the region S. of Judah, boundaries not exactly defined (see cities in it <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:21-32\" href=\"/Joshua.15.21-32\">Jos 15:21–32</a>), but c. from hills S. of Hebron to Ḳadesh, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ הַנּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 20:1\" href=\"/Genesis.20.1\">Gn 20:1</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:62\" href=\"/Genesis.24.62\">24:62</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:29\" href=\"/Numbers.13.29\">Nu 13:29</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:15\" href=\"/Judges.1.15\">Ju 1:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:19\" href=\"/Joshua.15.19\">Jos 15:19</a>; alm. = n.pr. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַנּ׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַנֶּ֫גְבָּה</span>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:9\" href=\"/Genesis.12.9\">Gn 12:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:1\" href=\"/Genesis.13.1\">13:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:17\" href=\"/Numbers.13.17\">Nu 13:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:22\" href=\"/Numbers.13.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:1\" href=\"/Numbers.21.1\">21:1</a> (all J), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 34:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.34.3\">Dt 34:3</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.7\">Dt 1:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:40\" href=\"/Joshua.10.40\">Jos 10:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:16\" href=\"/Joshua.11.16\">11:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:8\" href=\"/Joshua.12.8\">12:8</a> (all D), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:40\" href=\"/Numbers.33.40\">Nu 33:40</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:21\" h